hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"620","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Safar ka saamaan na baandha jaey magar teen masjidon ki taraf: Masjid-e-Haraam aur Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki masjid aur Masjid-e-Aqsa. (Bukhari: 1189)"
"621","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri is masjid mein namaz uskey siwa hazaar namazon se behtar hai, Masjid-e-Haraam key siwa. (Bukhari: 1190)"
"622","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo Chaasht mein namaz na padhtey they magar do dinon mein: Jis din Makkah tashreef laatey, beshak wo us mein Chaasht key waqt aatey aur Bait ka tawaaf kartey, phir Maqaam key peechey do rakatein padhtey. Aur jis din Quba ki masjid mein aatey, beshak wo us mein har Haftay aatey. Phir jab masjid mein daakhil hotey to naapasand kartey ke us se niklein yahan tak ke us mein namaz padhein. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur wo bayan kartey they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uski sawaar aur paidal ziyaarat kartey they. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur wo kehtey they: Beshak main waisa karta hun jaisa main ne apne saathiyon ko kartey huey dekha hai. Aur main kisi ko na rokta ke wo raat ya din ki kisi ghadi mein namaz padhey jis mein chaahe, magar ye ke sooraj nikalney aur uskey ghurub honay ka qasd na karo. (Bukhari: 1191, 1192)"
"623","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Merey ghar aur merey mimbar key darmiyaan Jannat key baaghon mein se baagh hai. Aur mera mimbar merey hauz par hai. (Bukhari: 1196). Namaz mein amal ki kitaab."
